WEBVTT

01:31.220 --> 01:33.568
[Episode 15]

01:36.239 --> 01:39.799
You little wretch, so eager to see me?

01:46.719 --> 01:50.280
I didn't expect you to still be alive.

01:50.280 --> 01:53.439
What? You want revenge?

01:53.439 --> 01:55.000
More than just revenge.

01:56.760 --> 01:59.719
- For what you did to Xiang and me,
- Xiang?

01:59.719 --> 02:01.959
I will pay it back a thousand times over.

02:01.959 --> 02:03.400
Don't you know very well

02:04.280 --> 02:06.040
what I did to Xiang?

02:06.680 --> 02:09.120
That little wretch from back then

02:09.120 --> 02:12.280
now bloomed far more than Xiang.

02:12.280 --> 02:13.280
Come here.

02:13.280 --> 02:14.280
How dare you!

02:28.280 --> 02:30.599
You used to kneel and beg for mercy.

02:30.599 --> 02:33.120
Now you've learned to put on official airs.

02:34.120 --> 02:35.680
Don't you want revenge?

02:37.800 --> 02:38.919
The knife is right there.

02:40.240 --> 02:41.240
What?

02:43.159 --> 02:44.159
Don't you dare take it?

02:50.960 --> 02:52.240
Of course.

02:52.240 --> 02:53.356
That night back then,

02:54.848 --> 02:57.560
you also wanted to kill me with a knife.

02:57.560 --> 03:00.599
Too bad I've lived another decade.

03:00.599 --> 03:02.719
It's a pity for your little sister.

03:03.520 --> 03:09.120
Now, she's long been a lonely ghost
in the mass grave.

03:09.120 --> 03:11.360
Thinking about it, what a real shame.

03:13.400 --> 03:16.360
The more she begged for mercy,
the more excited I got.

03:16.360 --> 03:18.199
<i>Let go of me! Let go!</i>

03:18.840 --> 03:20.319
<i>Let go of me!</i>

03:21.039 --> 03:22.560
- <i>Let go of me!</i>
- Do it.

03:23.319 --> 03:26.199
I'm now a law-abiding citizen, Zhai.

03:26.199 --> 03:29.080
As a court official, you can't kill me.

03:40.240 --> 03:41.400
It's been ten years.

03:41.400 --> 03:44.360
I am no longer that little beggar
you bullied at will.

03:44.360 --> 03:47.120
It's time to pay what you owe those children.

03:56.439 --> 03:59.080
This vase holds white plum blossoms
from Mount Zhongnan.

03:59.080 --> 04:00.240
Placed in the music house,

04:00.240 --> 04:01.919
they represent clear sound and elegant charm.

04:11.800 --> 04:12.960
Be careful not to hurt your hands.

04:15.240 --> 04:16.680
I'm truly sorry.

04:16.680 --> 04:19.959
I will compensate you
at three times the market price.

04:19.959 --> 04:21.480
It's just an ordinary object.

04:21.480 --> 04:23.000
You're too kind, Mr. He.

04:23.000 --> 04:27.319
But you have been visiting Huiyin House
quite frequently recently.

04:27.319 --> 04:30.759
I wonder if you are interested
in the dance and music

04:30.759 --> 04:34.680
or interested in me.

04:34.680 --> 04:37.079
Of course, I am interested in you.

04:37.079 --> 04:39.800
I have always found you
quite mysterious, Miss Situ.

04:39.800 --> 04:42.600
You're not as simple
as just a music house's owner.

04:42.600 --> 04:44.079
Likewise.

04:44.079 --> 04:46.240
I've hosted plenty of noble-born young men.

04:46.240 --> 04:47.800
So I've seen all kinds.

04:47.800 --> 04:52.319
Only you have a unique noble bearing
and extraordinary insight.

04:52.319 --> 04:56.040
You don't seem like an ordinary merchant,
as Mr. Shen said.

04:57.560 --> 05:00.639
Wait, Miss Situ, I met you much earlier.

05:00.639 --> 05:01.920
But now I can't even get a word in.

05:01.920 --> 05:04.480
You two are chatting as if you're confidants.

05:04.480 --> 05:06.319
Then I hope that Miss Situ and I

05:06.319 --> 05:10.240
won't suddenly go
from confidants to strangers.

05:10.240 --> 05:12.680
I could become strangers with anyone.

05:13.399 --> 05:14.800
But with you,

05:16.360 --> 05:17.560
I would be reluctant to.

05:17.560 --> 05:19.480
[Huiyin House]

05:19.480 --> 05:21.199
Your Majesty no longer doubts her,

05:21.199 --> 05:22.720
and now she's a confidant?

05:22.720 --> 05:25.120
As the most renowned
music house owner in the capital,

05:25.120 --> 05:27.120
she is smooth and slick, missing a trick.

05:27.120 --> 05:28.800
You believe what she said?

05:28.800 --> 05:29.879
Then why would you...

05:30.480 --> 05:32.240
I was just going along with it.

05:32.240 --> 05:33.439
She has no sword wound.

05:33.439 --> 05:34.800
You still suspect her?

05:34.800 --> 05:35.959
Today's probing

05:35.959 --> 05:39.120
makes me more certain
that her identity is far from ordinary.

05:39.120 --> 05:42.480
Zhi Shu, follow the musician's caravan
to the border.

05:42.480 --> 05:43.879
Whatever they purchase,

05:43.879 --> 05:46.199
investigate everything thoroughly.

05:46.199 --> 05:47.199
Yes, Your Majesty.

05:49.319 --> 05:52.360
Help! Help!

05:52.360 --> 05:55.959
Meng Ting Hui from the Censorate
is trying to kill me!

05:55.959 --> 05:57.360
Report it quickly!

05:57.360 --> 05:59.319
Help!

05:59.319 --> 06:01.439
She's killing me!

06:01.439 --> 06:05.399
Meng Ting Hui from the Censorate

06:06.000 --> 06:10.240
is trying to kill me in broad daylight!

06:11.720 --> 06:15.240
I beg you all, save this old man!

06:34.480 --> 06:38.240
Miss Meng, spare my life! Miss Meng!

06:40.160 --> 06:42.519
I'm just a commoner.

06:43.199 --> 06:46.199
I have never done anything wicked in my life,

06:46.199 --> 06:47.279
Miss Meng.

06:47.279 --> 06:49.480
I only know that in Shazhou,

06:49.480 --> 06:52.920
you were a lying and cheating petty crook
who left blood in your wake.

06:52.920 --> 06:54.720
But rest assured, Miss Meng.

06:54.720 --> 06:57.319
If you spare my life,

06:57.319 --> 07:01.720
I'll never be so bold
as to mention your dark past.

07:01.720 --> 07:04.000
- It's Miss Meng from the Censorate?
- Yes.

07:04.000 --> 07:07.000
- Official robes, and she bullies a cripple?
- Please spare me.

07:07.000 --> 07:09.000
- Spare me.
- I wonder how he offended her.

07:09.000 --> 07:10.399
Please spare me.

07:10.399 --> 07:11.399
Stop pretending.

07:13.639 --> 07:15.439
You think you can get away like this?

07:17.000 --> 07:18.600
Wretched girl.

07:20.040 --> 07:24.560
If you have the guts, kill me in public.

07:28.160 --> 07:30.240
I'm now a law-abiding citizen.

07:34.759 --> 07:37.519
Come on, do it.

07:45.079 --> 07:47.040
What? Miss Meng...

07:49.839 --> 07:50.839
Back then,

07:51.839 --> 07:53.839
that persecuted little beggar

07:55.199 --> 07:57.600
couldn't do anything to you.

07:57.600 --> 07:59.600
If one day I hold the knife,

07:59.600 --> 08:01.639
I will cut you to pieces.

08:01.639 --> 08:04.360
With a little beggar like you

08:04.360 --> 08:06.240
and your empty words?

08:06.959 --> 08:08.000
But today,

08:09.319 --> 08:11.439
I wear the official robes of the court

08:12.199 --> 08:14.040
and answer to the law of the realm.

08:15.120 --> 08:20.600
And with this office and this rank,
I will personally execute you.

08:20.600 --> 08:22.199
How dare you!

08:28.040 --> 08:29.680
I'll kill you!

08:35.720 --> 08:37.720
Today is the day you die!

08:43.360 --> 08:44.600
Let go of me!

08:46.200 --> 08:47.919
I'll kill you!

08:49.559 --> 08:53.120
Help! Help...

09:10.759 --> 09:11.759
Meng Ting Hui!

09:26.740 --> 09:27.840
[Bofeng House]

09:27.840 --> 09:29.600
- Number eighty-eight.
- Here! Right here!

09:29.600 --> 09:30.799
Please come in, you two.

09:32.320 --> 09:33.879
Everyone, please be patient.

09:33.879 --> 09:35.519
It will be your turn soon.

09:35.519 --> 09:37.639
Everyone, Bofeng House is full today.

09:37.639 --> 09:39.799
You'll have to wait
about an incense stick's time for a table.

09:39.799 --> 09:42.679
Guests still waiting for their tables
can have a cup of ginger tea.

09:42.679 --> 09:44.720
The weather is cold. Don't catch a chill.

09:45.919 --> 09:47.320
All flashy and showy.

09:47.320 --> 09:49.200
You're just riding on your court connections.

09:49.200 --> 09:51.340
Let me see how long you,
a grasshopper after autumn,

09:51.340 --> 09:52.559
can keep on hopping.

09:52.559 --> 09:54.720
You don't even have what it takes to hop.

09:54.720 --> 09:57.159
Please, let Bofeng House get into trouble.

09:57.159 --> 09:59.159
My lady! My lady!

10:00.320 --> 10:02.360
My lady!

10:02.360 --> 10:03.840
- I saw Miss Meng...
- What happened to Meng?

10:03.840 --> 10:05.240
Miss Meng has killed someone!

10:07.399 --> 10:08.399
Watch the shop.

10:08.399 --> 10:10.279
So she killed someone!

10:10.279 --> 10:12.320
I knew you wouldn't be hopping for long.

10:28.919 --> 10:29.919
Miss Yan.

10:31.080 --> 10:32.080
Mr. Shen.

10:34.679 --> 10:35.960
Where are you going?

10:35.960 --> 10:37.240
I'm going to the Censorate.

10:37.240 --> 10:38.519
They said Meng has killed someone.

10:38.519 --> 10:39.759
His Majesty saw it with his own eyes.

10:39.759 --> 10:41.080
Miss Meng has been taken into the palace.

10:41.080 --> 10:43.240
Meng isn't someone who kills innocent people.

10:43.240 --> 10:45.200
There must be a reason for her doing that.

10:45.200 --> 10:46.440
I'll go to the palace to find her.

10:48.559 --> 10:50.559
No one can enter
without His Majesty's summons.

10:50.559 --> 10:51.600
If I can't enter,

10:51.600 --> 10:52.879
I'll wait for her at the gate.

10:54.600 --> 10:55.600
I'll take you there.

10:55.600 --> 10:58.159
Mr. Shen, we need to go.
Official business can't wait.

10:58.159 --> 11:00.000
You go ahead.
My horse is fast. I'll catch up later.

11:00.000 --> 11:01.919
Mr. Shen, the snow is falling heavily.

11:01.919 --> 11:04.960
It is too dangerous for you
to travel alone on horseback.

11:04.960 --> 11:06.679
Forget it. I'll figure it out myself.

11:08.480 --> 11:09.480
Do as I say.

11:09.480 --> 11:10.480
Yes.

11:14.240 --> 11:15.240
Get on the horse.

11:39.080 --> 11:40.080
Your Majesty,

11:40.080 --> 11:41.559
the Ministry of Revenue has verified

11:41.559 --> 11:43.799
that the man's name is Zhai.
He is nearly fifty

11:43.799 --> 11:45.200
and suffers from a leg ailment.

11:45.200 --> 11:47.799
Although he is poor,
he has never broken the law.

11:47.799 --> 11:51.559
Meng Ting Hui tried to kill an innocent.
That's a capital offense.

11:51.559 --> 11:53.919
I only kill those who deserve it.

11:54.600 --> 11:56.080
Zhai is not a law-abiding citizen

11:56.080 --> 11:58.960
but a notorious human trafficker, Master Wen.

11:58.960 --> 12:01.080
Nonsense! Your Majesty,

12:01.080 --> 12:03.136
Zhai's household records
and his neighbors' accounts

12:03.136 --> 12:05.039
are sufficient to prove his innocence.

12:05.039 --> 12:06.039
If he were innocent,

12:07.200 --> 12:09.000
there'd be no innocents in this world.

12:13.080 --> 12:14.200
Summon Zhai.

12:14.200 --> 12:15.639
Bring Zhai in.

12:34.759 --> 12:38.360
I'm Zhai. Greetings, Your Majesty.

12:38.360 --> 12:39.360
Raise your head.

12:42.759 --> 12:45.960
What exactly is the grudge
between you and Meng Ting Hui?

12:45.960 --> 12:47.360
Speak truthfully.

12:47.360 --> 12:48.440
Your Majesty,

12:49.200 --> 12:51.559
my ancestral home is Shazhou.

12:51.559 --> 12:53.679
As a fellow townsman of Miss Meng,

12:53.679 --> 12:56.600
I know she was once a little beggar
on Shazhou's streets,

12:56.600 --> 13:00.559
stealing and cheating her way
through every day.

13:00.559 --> 13:04.960
She once poisoned someone
just to steal half a string of copper coins.

13:04.960 --> 13:07.919
She also often organized other little beggars

13:07.919 --> 13:10.360
to specifically swindle passing merchants.

13:12.200 --> 13:13.200
Miss Meng,

13:13.879 --> 13:15.639
it's been ten years.

13:15.639 --> 13:17.639
If you hadn't rushed out to kill me,

13:17.639 --> 13:22.519
I wouldn't recognize you as the little beggar
who stole my silver back then.

13:28.919 --> 13:31.679
Do you think changing your name
can erase your sins?

13:32.480 --> 13:33.919
Ten years ago,

13:33.919 --> 13:35.399
you lived off selling stolen children.

13:35.399 --> 13:37.879
You forced them to steal and beg
to earn you money.

13:37.879 --> 13:40.120
You would break their limbs
at the slightest resistance.

13:40.120 --> 13:41.679
You raped young girls

13:41.679 --> 13:43.360
and sold them into slavery.

13:43.360 --> 13:46.240
My elder sister Xiang died at your hands.

13:49.799 --> 13:51.799
So what if he changed his name?

13:51.799 --> 13:53.840
Even if he were reduced to ashes,

13:54.480 --> 13:55.480
I...

13:58.639 --> 13:59.840
I would still recognize him.

14:04.000 --> 14:07.080
Miss Meng, do you have evidence?

14:07.080 --> 14:09.240
You wear that official robe,

14:09.240 --> 14:12.440
and you think your bare word can convict me?

14:13.320 --> 14:17.919
I know, I'm just a commoner.

14:17.919 --> 14:20.480
My words carry little weight.

14:20.480 --> 14:23.600
I'm not Master Wen at all.

14:24.320 --> 14:28.480
I beg Your Majesty to judge justly.

14:29.559 --> 14:30.960
I am the evidence.

14:33.000 --> 14:35.600
I'm one of the children you trafficked.

14:35.600 --> 14:40.000
Your leg was crippled by me.

14:42.399 --> 14:43.960
Audacious Meng Ting Hui!

14:43.960 --> 14:45.519
Bullying a commoner in the imperial court.

14:45.519 --> 14:47.639
Where do you place His Majesty
and all the officials?

14:47.639 --> 14:48.960
She's killing me!

14:50.919 --> 14:51.919
Miss Meng.

14:57.639 --> 14:58.759
Your Majesty,

14:59.480 --> 15:02.279
she is talking more and more absurdly.

15:02.279 --> 15:04.360
My leg

15:04.360 --> 15:08.440
was accidentally crippled
while unloading goods in Shazhou.

15:08.440 --> 15:11.039
That's why I came to the capital
to make a living,

15:11.039 --> 15:12.039
Your Majesty.

15:13.120 --> 15:14.440
Miss Meng,

15:14.440 --> 15:16.279
how could you frame me at will?

15:16.279 --> 15:17.679
You human trafficker!

15:17.679 --> 15:18.799
You're twisting the truth

15:18.799 --> 15:19.799
and turning it back on me!

15:19.799 --> 15:22.159
I truly regret
not stabbing you to death back then.

15:22.159 --> 15:23.159
Meng Ting Hui!

15:26.120 --> 15:27.720
Do you have any witnesses or evidence

15:28.399 --> 15:31.120
to prove that he is Master Wen,
the human trafficker you speak of?

15:32.039 --> 15:33.039
I...

15:35.360 --> 15:36.360
have none.

15:40.919 --> 15:42.039
Your Majesty,

15:42.039 --> 15:43.879
I guarantee it with my life

15:43.879 --> 15:46.039
that every word I say is true.

15:46.039 --> 15:47.919
He deliberately appeared
to lure me into a trap.

15:48.600 --> 15:50.320
I beg Your Majesty to investigate thoroughly.

15:51.240 --> 15:53.320
Your Majesty,

15:53.320 --> 15:55.559
I'm just a wretched old man.

15:55.559 --> 16:01.200
Why would I bother putting on a show
just to frame her?

16:01.200 --> 16:05.200
They say officials protect each other.

16:05.200 --> 16:08.399
If you intend to shield and cover for her,

16:08.399 --> 16:13.559
what can a commoner like me do to you?

16:14.559 --> 16:18.120
Your Majesty, since Meng Ting Hui
cannot produce evidence,

16:18.120 --> 16:21.639
I beg Your Majesty to abolish the Censorate,

16:21.639 --> 16:24.240
throw Meng Ting Hui into prison,

16:24.240 --> 16:27.000
strip her of rank, and try her
for the court's honor.

16:28.080 --> 16:31.799
Your Majesty, I know
you appreciate and cherish talent.

16:32.480 --> 16:36.639
But Meng Ting Hui has crossed the line,
and the repercussions are significant.

16:36.639 --> 16:37.879
If not handled properly

16:37.879 --> 16:40.000
and word spreads
that the court shields its officials

16:40.000 --> 16:41.600
and an innocent is nearly killed,

16:41.600 --> 16:43.600
it may damage the court's prestige

16:43.600 --> 16:45.399
and shake the foundation of the state.

16:45.399 --> 16:48.279
I also beg Your Majesty

16:48.279 --> 16:51.039
to abolish the Censorate
in accordance with the law

16:51.039 --> 16:53.480
and severely punish Meng Ting Hui
to bring peace to the realm.

16:54.399 --> 16:56.519
I second the motion.

16:56.519 --> 16:58.519
I second the motion.

16:58.519 --> 17:00.399
I second the motion.

17:32.039 --> 17:33.160
Raise your head and look.

17:36.119 --> 17:38.359
Do you recognize this dagger?

17:38.359 --> 17:39.839
I don't recognize it.

17:39.839 --> 17:41.799
Then let me jog your memory.

17:41.799 --> 17:43.160
Lord Xu, do you remember

17:43.920 --> 17:46.000
where I was ten years ago?

17:46.000 --> 17:47.519
Your Majesty,

17:47.519 --> 17:50.359
ten years ago,
you were just fourteen years old.

17:50.359 --> 17:53.119
You toured the realm for the first time
on behalf of your father.

17:53.119 --> 17:54.680
You personally went to Shazhou on the border

17:54.680 --> 17:57.119
and destroyed
the local human trafficking gang in one go.

18:13.400 --> 18:17.640
<i>The boy who saved me back then
was actually you.</i>

18:17.640 --> 18:18.960
Could it be that Your Majesty...

18:18.960 --> 18:19.960
That's right.

18:20.920 --> 18:21.920
It was me.

18:39.319 --> 18:43.160
Meng Ting Hui stabbed your leg
with this very dagger.

18:57.640 --> 19:00.640
I saw everything you did with my own eyes.

19:00.640 --> 19:03.480
Are you saying that I am wronging you?

19:04.839 --> 19:06.720
Didn't you want evidence?

19:06.720 --> 19:09.359
Meng Ting Hui has no evidence. But I do.

19:09.359 --> 19:10.720
I am the witness.

19:10.720 --> 19:13.359
And this dagger is the physical evidence.

19:14.079 --> 19:16.920
This dagger's triangular blade is unique

19:16.920 --> 19:18.960
and matches the wound on your body.

19:18.960 --> 19:22.519
Do you need me to personally
examine the wound to prove it?

19:22.519 --> 19:24.759
If Your Majesty judges the case so hastily

19:24.759 --> 19:26.319
and shows favoritism towards Meng Ting Hui,

19:26.319 --> 19:28.119
the people of the realm will say

19:28.119 --> 19:29.880
that by having Your Majesty's favor,

19:29.880 --> 19:32.440
court officials can kill people at will.

19:32.440 --> 19:36.000
That will chill the hearts of the people.

19:36.000 --> 19:37.000
Di Nian.

19:39.599 --> 19:40.799
Bring the witness.

19:55.440 --> 19:56.440
This guilty servant Hei Ying

19:57.119 --> 19:58.160
greets Your Majesty.

20:01.880 --> 20:04.960
<i>Ten years ago, I was the one
who got Master Wen out of Shazhou.</i>

20:06.160 --> 20:08.240
<i>Back then, he ran a trade
in trafficking children,</i>

20:08.880 --> 20:10.400
<i>forcing them to steal.</i>

20:10.400 --> 20:12.839
<i>Those who disobeyed
were tortured to death and buried.</i>

20:12.839 --> 20:15.079
I was once Master Wen's trusted confidant

20:15.079 --> 20:16.880
and kidnapped thirty-nine children for him.

20:17.759 --> 20:21.480
Back then, Miss Meng and her sister
tried to escape many times,

20:21.480 --> 20:23.200
and I was always ordered to chase them back.

20:23.200 --> 20:26.640
I personally saw Master Wen
forge a law-abiding identity in Shazhou.

20:26.640 --> 20:29.079
And now he is hiding in the capital
with a new identity.

20:29.079 --> 20:31.319
In these ten years,
we have never had any contact.

20:31.319 --> 20:33.440
Master Wen has an arrow wound on his chest.

20:33.440 --> 20:36.359
It was left by Your Majesty
when you were touring in Shazhou.

20:36.359 --> 20:38.960
This man is Master Wen without a doubt.

20:43.000 --> 20:45.440
Having been hiding in the capital
for many years,

20:45.440 --> 20:47.480
you suddenly showed up to provoke her.

20:47.480 --> 20:49.279
This cannot be a coincidence.

20:51.720 --> 20:55.559
Speak! Who is behind you and ordered you

20:55.559 --> 20:57.119
to frame Meng Ting Hui?

20:57.839 --> 20:59.799
Y-Your Majesty, spare me.

20:59.799 --> 21:01.640
Please spare me.

21:01.640 --> 21:05.039
I hate Meng Ting Hui
for crippling me back then.

21:05.039 --> 21:09.079
So I agreed to help the Huxiao Gang's master
get rid of her.

21:14.000 --> 21:15.480
The Huxiao Gang.

21:16.440 --> 21:17.559
Ministers,

21:18.480 --> 21:21.000
the Huxiao Gang plotted
to frame a court-appointed official.

21:21.000 --> 21:22.440
Now the truth has come to light.

21:23.079 --> 21:25.839
Do you still want to abolish the Censorate
and punish Meng Ting Hui?

21:34.599 --> 21:37.720
Study, pass the Imperial Exam,

21:37.720 --> 21:39.359
and become a court official.

21:39.359 --> 21:42.000
<i>How can I become as powerful as you?</i>

21:42.000 --> 21:44.599
Study, pass the Imperial Exam,

21:44.599 --> 21:45.599
and become a court official.

21:46.440 --> 21:50.440
When you hold the reins of power,
everything will be different.

21:51.279 --> 21:52.720
You did it all.

21:55.400 --> 21:59.000
You walked step by step right up to me.

22:38.359 --> 22:40.759
Meng Ting Hui, as a court-appointed official,

22:40.759 --> 22:42.440
you harmed someone without orders.

22:42.440 --> 22:43.799
That warrants a severe punishment.

22:43.799 --> 22:46.240
But given the cruelty
you suffered at his hands

22:46.240 --> 22:48.200
and your pitiable circumstances,

22:48.839 --> 22:50.359
I fine you three months' wages.

22:50.359 --> 22:52.200
I hope you will learn from this

22:52.880 --> 22:54.960
and not let hatred cloud your judgment.

22:58.359 --> 23:00.359
Thank Your Majesty for your mercy.

23:02.039 --> 23:03.759
I will remember this teaching

23:05.039 --> 23:06.039
and live up to your grace.

23:07.680 --> 23:10.160
You trafficked children, killed the innocent,

23:10.160 --> 23:12.079
and framed a court-appointed official.

23:12.079 --> 23:14.279
Under the Laws of Ning Empire,
your crimes call for one sentence:

23:14.279 --> 23:15.359
death by beheading.

23:19.440 --> 23:21.240
Your Majesty, spare me!

23:21.240 --> 23:22.559
Miss Meng,

23:22.559 --> 23:23.759
spare me!

23:24.400 --> 23:28.200
Your Majesty, even if these people's crimes
are unforgivable

23:28.200 --> 23:30.480
and Huxiao Gang's crimes warrant death,

23:30.480 --> 23:33.472
letting such a cheating and lying beggar

23:33.472 --> 23:36.440
with a notorious record
be in charge of the Censorate

23:36.440 --> 23:38.039
is hardly convincing to the public.

23:38.039 --> 23:39.160
Lord Xu,

23:39.160 --> 23:41.480
can't a beggar study and enter officialdom?

23:41.480 --> 23:44.359
Everything I did in the past
was forced by Master Wen.

23:44.960 --> 23:47.200
I studied hard, achieved scholarly rank,

23:47.200 --> 23:48.920
and walked step by step to where I am today.

23:48.920 --> 23:50.079
If I am not qualified,

23:51.519 --> 23:53.960
was Ding Chong,
who treated lives like weeds, qualified?

23:53.960 --> 23:56.400
Was Wan Kai,
who shielded the Huxiao Gang, qualified?

23:56.400 --> 23:59.559
Or were those like Mr. Zheng,
who were arrested

23:59.559 --> 24:01.079
in the gambling house case, qualified?

24:01.079 --> 24:02.440
I almost forgot.

24:02.440 --> 24:05.440
They were
all your favorite disciples, Lord Xu.

24:05.440 --> 24:08.039
- How dare you!
- As court-appointed officials,

24:08.039 --> 24:09.799
you failed to see clearly

24:09.799 --> 24:11.839
and nearly became the Huxiao Gang's tools.

24:12.440 --> 24:16.039
After this, you will all return and ponder

24:16.759 --> 24:18.799
the proper conduct of an official.

24:23.160 --> 24:24.599
What should we do?

24:24.599 --> 24:26.240
She's been on trial all night

24:26.240 --> 24:27.519
and still not been released yet.

24:29.200 --> 24:32.200
You have no idea what Master Wen did to her.

24:32.200 --> 24:34.640
That beast
should have been cut to pieces long ago.

24:34.640 --> 24:35.759
It's all my fault.

24:35.759 --> 24:37.839
Meng became an official
with great difficulty.

24:37.839 --> 24:40.200
I should have noticed earlier
that she was restless

24:40.200 --> 24:41.799
and killed Master Wen for her.

24:41.799 --> 24:42.799
I...

24:47.599 --> 24:49.440
Don't worry. Wait a little longer.

25:01.720 --> 25:02.720
Where is she?

25:03.640 --> 25:05.799
His Majesty hasn't put Meng in prison,
has he?

25:05.799 --> 25:07.079
Wait here patiently.

25:07.079 --> 25:08.200
I'll go check it out.

25:10.680 --> 25:11.680
Meng!

25:15.440 --> 25:16.440
Meng,

25:17.200 --> 25:19.319
thank goodness, you're finally out.

25:19.319 --> 25:20.440
What's wrong?

25:20.440 --> 25:21.440
Are you hurt?

25:22.680 --> 25:25.000
How did His Majesty rule
on the matter of Master Wen?

25:25.000 --> 25:27.279
Also, did His Majesty punish you?

25:30.240 --> 25:31.240
Fu Zhi,

25:33.319 --> 25:36.079
I've finally avenged Xiang.

25:39.200 --> 25:42.880
Back then, I couldn't kill him
with my own hands.

25:46.079 --> 25:47.880
His Majesty has appointed me
to oversee the execution.

25:54.039 --> 25:55.039
I finally...

26:09.480 --> 26:10.480
Finally...

26:15.079 --> 26:16.480
It's all over.

26:17.440 --> 26:18.920
Your nightmare is past.

26:19.960 --> 26:21.200
I'll be with you from now on.

26:22.240 --> 26:25.279
Miss Meng, getting your revenge
is a good thing.

26:25.279 --> 26:27.440
But was His Majesty angry with you
because of this?

26:28.480 --> 26:29.480
Right.

26:30.799 --> 26:32.519
Do you remember the boy I mentioned?

26:33.359 --> 26:35.559
The one who saved me ten years ago?

26:36.960 --> 26:38.480
Yes, I remember.

26:38.480 --> 26:40.559
You even drew many portraits of him.

26:40.559 --> 26:42.039
He turned out to be His Majesty.

26:42.839 --> 26:43.839
His Majesty?

26:45.279 --> 26:46.839
I just feel like all of this

26:49.200 --> 26:51.359
is like a dream.

26:51.359 --> 26:53.119
I never imagined

26:53.119 --> 26:57.200
these ten years have only
made His Majesty more handsome.

26:57.839 --> 26:59.759
Still in the mood for such fancies?

26:59.759 --> 27:00.759
It seems you're fine.

27:01.759 --> 27:04.400
Mr. Shen, why are you here?

27:04.400 --> 27:06.160
Yesterday, she was so anxious to find you.

27:06.160 --> 27:08.200
I came along
in case she did something reckless.

27:08.200 --> 27:09.759
But seeing you safe and sound today,

27:09.759 --> 27:11.000
I can set off with peace of mind.

27:16.839 --> 27:18.359
Thank you, Mr. Shen.

27:18.359 --> 27:19.400
But rest assured.

27:19.400 --> 27:22.799
I will not fall for you
just because you helped me.

27:22.799 --> 27:23.799
That would be best.

27:31.880 --> 27:32.880
Yan Fu Zhi.

27:35.880 --> 27:36.880
Let's go home.

27:57.119 --> 27:59.000
The hour of the third quarter of noon
is here.

27:59.640 --> 28:01.079
Execute now!

28:01.079 --> 28:02.079
Behead!

28:29.359 --> 28:30.359
Ting Hui.

28:37.720 --> 28:38.920
Xiang.

28:46.279 --> 28:47.400
My dearest Ting Hui,

28:48.240 --> 28:51.000
I've seen all you've done for me.

28:51.000 --> 28:52.000
Thank you.

28:55.960 --> 28:57.559
Xiang,

28:57.559 --> 29:00.440
I couldn't save you in the end.

29:02.000 --> 29:03.000
I'm sorry.

29:03.799 --> 29:06.960
I have never regretted saving you that day.

29:07.759 --> 29:10.599
Now, seeing you become so well,

29:11.599 --> 29:12.680
I feel even more gratified.

29:27.240 --> 29:29.640
Let go of the past knots in your heart.

29:30.480 --> 29:31.720
In the future,

29:31.720 --> 29:36.279
you must see
all the good views of the world for me.

30:27.799 --> 30:29.200
Xiang!

30:36.160 --> 30:37.960
Xiang!

31:35.072 --> 31:36.240
[Shazhou]
I heard

31:36.240 --> 31:39.119
one was a young emperor traveling incognito,

31:39.720 --> 31:43.119
and the other was a lonely orphan girl
wandering the streets.

31:43.119 --> 31:45.559
Heaven tied a red thread between them,

31:45.559 --> 31:49.000
bringing the people from two worlds apart
into a head-on collision.

31:49.000 --> 31:51.799
Isn't that even more exciting
than a storybook?

31:51.799 --> 31:52.920
Truly.

31:52.920 --> 31:54.359
Fate is truly something

31:54.359 --> 31:56.160
inexplicable and indescribable.

31:56.839 --> 31:59.160
I really want
to catch a glimpse of her beauty.

31:59.160 --> 32:00.160
Too bad.

32:00.160 --> 32:02.039
- Bofeng House isn't opening.
- Come on!

32:02.039 --> 32:04.319
- I came early in the morning.
- Make way, please!

32:04.319 --> 32:05.960
- Here, my lady.
- In this world,

32:05.960 --> 32:09.279
there are many
inexplicable and indescribable things.

32:09.279 --> 32:11.960
Some people have no regard for the law.

32:11.960 --> 32:14.000
She actually killed someone in the street!

32:14.000 --> 32:17.599
What's the difference between her
and a butcher in the market?

32:17.599 --> 32:20.079
She relies solely on imperial favor.

32:20.079 --> 32:22.720
What real talent does she have?

32:22.720 --> 32:23.720
My lady,

32:23.720 --> 32:26.960
when those noble ladies had tea
at our Chunman House the other day,

32:26.960 --> 32:29.079
didn't you chat very happily with them?

32:29.079 --> 32:31.359
You must know the inside story, right?

32:31.359 --> 32:32.559
- Inside story?
- There's an inside story?

32:32.559 --> 32:34.160
- Lady Yu.
- Tell us! Spill it!

32:34.160 --> 32:36.839
The noble ladies are all gossiping

32:36.839 --> 32:39.160
that Meng Ting Hui is a fox spirit reborn.

32:39.160 --> 32:40.359
- A fox spirit?
- A fox spirit reborn?

32:40.359 --> 32:42.039
She beguiles the monarch.

32:43.559 --> 32:44.920
My lady, are you alright?

32:44.920 --> 32:47.279
Yan Fu Zhi, you dare to splash water on me!

32:48.880 --> 32:49.880
Listen.

32:49.880 --> 32:51.880
If you dare to say a single bad word
about Meng again,

32:51.880 --> 32:53.440
I will smash your Chunman House to pieces.

32:53.440 --> 32:55.640
And you dared to spread rumors about her.

32:55.640 --> 32:57.088
Aren't you afraid
His Majesty will behead you?

32:57.088 --> 32:58.112
- I...
- Try it!

32:58.112 --> 32:59.136
- Let's go.
- Come on!

32:59.136 --> 33:00.480
- You just wait!
- Let's go.

33:02.119 --> 33:04.319
How could Lord Gu say such a thing?

33:04.319 --> 33:08.079
Father, you didn't attend court.
The news must be wrong.

33:08.079 --> 33:09.559
Father.

33:09.559 --> 33:13.000
If you don't believe it,
listen to what Nian says.

33:16.599 --> 33:17.880
Zhi Li,

33:17.880 --> 33:19.680
I was right there in the court.

33:19.680 --> 33:23.160
Lord Gu did express support
for abolishing the Censorate

33:23.880 --> 33:25.359
and severely punishing Miss Meng.

33:25.359 --> 33:27.759
He has always supported
the Imperial Exam for Women

33:27.759 --> 33:29.960
and has repeatedly advised
in favor of Miss Meng.

33:29.960 --> 33:32.319
Why would he suddenly change his stance
and contradict himself?

33:32.319 --> 33:33.559
Zhi Li,

33:33.559 --> 33:35.720
Lord Gu appears open and honorable
on the surface.

33:35.720 --> 33:37.079
But think carefully.

33:37.079 --> 33:39.279
Why has he been playing both sides
all these years?

33:39.279 --> 33:40.359
Nian,

33:40.359 --> 33:42.200
you misunderstand Lord Gu

33:42.200 --> 33:44.400
- because you don't truly know him.
- Nian.

33:44.400 --> 33:46.519
Go change your clothes and sit down to eat.

33:51.519 --> 33:52.839
Father,

33:52.839 --> 33:55.039
there must be a reason
for Lord Gu to act that way.

33:55.039 --> 33:56.119
I'll go ask him.

33:56.119 --> 33:57.119
Stop.

34:01.079 --> 34:03.039
I allowed you to study under him

34:03.039 --> 34:05.680
because you loved painting
and your brushwork had spirit.

34:07.759 --> 34:10.079
Now that you have grown up,

34:10.079 --> 34:11.599
you must remember better

34:11.599 --> 34:14.400
that a teacher-student bond
demands propriety,

34:14.400 --> 34:17.000
and you must act with moderation.

34:17.000 --> 34:19.920
Father, I respect Lord Gu very much.

34:19.920 --> 34:21.440
So I don't want him to be misunderstood.

34:21.440 --> 34:22.440
Zhi Li.

34:26.719 --> 34:28.920
Child, in the imperial court,

34:28.920 --> 34:31.400
people's hearts are unfathomable depths.

34:31.400 --> 34:33.880
Many things are not simply black or white.

34:33.880 --> 34:34.960
If you go ask today,

34:34.960 --> 34:37.760
whether he answers or not,
it will be meaningless.

34:38.599 --> 34:40.920
Because what you see
is just the tip of an iceberg.

34:41.599 --> 34:46.000
Only by stepping outside the board
can you see the full picture.

34:51.199 --> 34:52.199
Let's eat.

35:08.719 --> 35:09.719
Thank you, Father.

35:30.464 --> 35:33.216
[Censorate]

35:46.079 --> 35:47.559
Miss Meng,

35:47.559 --> 35:51.000
I hope you will accept these things.

35:51.000 --> 35:54.639
Aren't these what you usually like the most?

35:54.639 --> 35:58.280
I didn't expect
you suffered so much as a child.

35:58.280 --> 36:01.280
I thought the Jiang Mei Er affair
had already caused you enough grief.

36:01.280 --> 36:03.239
But I never imagined
Master Wen was so vicious.

36:03.880 --> 36:07.719
You grew up in hardship,
yet you still achieved the Triple First.

36:07.719 --> 36:09.199
I am truly filled with admiration.

36:11.199 --> 36:13.559
I don't know how to express my feelings.

36:16.159 --> 36:20.880
I only hope these items
can warm the coldness of your past.

36:27.800 --> 36:30.679
Zhi Li, there's no need to cry.

36:31.920 --> 36:34.559
It's all in the past.
Everything ahead is new.

36:50.400 --> 36:54.679
Miss Meng, you had no one to rely on
at such a young age.

36:55.639 --> 36:57.120
Yet you had to face

36:58.400 --> 37:02.119
the human trafficker's knife alone.
How did you make it through?

37:03.480 --> 37:04.896
If your family knew,

37:07.104 --> 37:08.320
they would be heartbroken.

37:09.079 --> 37:10.239
Since I could remember,

37:12.440 --> 37:13.840
I'd been wandering the streets.

37:14.719 --> 37:15.719
I'm used to it.

37:16.719 --> 37:18.519
Being able to survive was already very lucky.

37:20.280 --> 37:21.280
It's all my fault.

37:23.159 --> 37:24.480
If I could have met you earlier,

37:25.880 --> 37:27.360
even if it meant risking my life,

37:28.599 --> 37:30.360
I would never have let you
suffer even a little.

37:35.199 --> 37:37.880
- A narrow escape...
- Often brings good fortune.

37:40.679 --> 37:42.280
I am fine now, aren't I?

37:42.280 --> 37:44.159
Miss Meng, from now on,

37:44.880 --> 37:47.760
the path you want to walk, I will walk first.

37:47.760 --> 37:50.039
And the people you want to kill, I will...

37:50.039 --> 37:51.119
Alright.

37:51.119 --> 37:53.239
I know both of you mean well for me.

37:53.920 --> 37:56.840
Master Wen was instigated by the Huxiao Gang.

37:56.840 --> 37:57.840
Since Ling Yun Fei

37:58.760 --> 38:00.800
has targeted me repeatedly,

38:00.800 --> 38:02.480
he will definitely not stop here.

38:02.480 --> 38:03.960
We need to act quickly.

38:03.960 --> 38:05.320
Ling Yun Fei.

38:06.960 --> 38:11.079
This time,
we'll settle all scores, old and new.

38:11.079 --> 38:12.480
Master Wen was quite tight-lipped.

38:13.159 --> 38:15.239
He only admitted
to being instigated by the Huxiao Gang.

38:15.239 --> 38:17.599
But he refused
to reveal the Huxiao Gang's den.

38:18.559 --> 38:22.239
Where exactly is the Huxiao Gang's den?

38:22.239 --> 38:24.280
The Huxiao Gang now is not like before.

38:25.320 --> 38:26.639
They are not hiding as deeply anymore.

38:29.320 --> 38:34.199
I have something to do later.
I need to leave first.

38:34.199 --> 38:35.199
- Where?
- Where are you going?

38:36.199 --> 38:37.480
To meet an old acquaintance.

39:01.599 --> 39:03.880
Your Majesty recognized me long ago.

39:03.880 --> 39:05.079
Why didn't you say it sooner?

39:05.840 --> 39:06.880
I was thinking

39:07.800 --> 39:09.880
maybe you had already forgotten me long ago.

39:23.079 --> 39:24.800
You didn't draw this, did you?

39:25.960 --> 39:30.519
I thought if one day
I could see that boy again,

39:31.719 --> 39:33.159
I would give it to him personally

39:35.000 --> 39:36.639
to thank him for saving my life.

39:38.079 --> 39:39.239
So in your heart,

39:40.800 --> 39:42.199
I was so handsome back then.

39:49.440 --> 39:50.559
The boy.

39:53.119 --> 39:54.119
He Du.

39:54.880 --> 39:55.880
The emperor.

39:57.239 --> 40:01.440
Over ten years, you have witnessed my life
under different identities.

40:20.360 --> 40:21.480
Xiang, eat quickly.

40:39.400 --> 40:40.400
Thank you.

40:48.840 --> 40:51.679
I was young back then
and didn't think thoroughly.

40:51.679 --> 40:55.320
It was my fault
for not settling you properly.

40:58.519 --> 41:00.559
Your Majesty has helped me a lot.

41:01.320 --> 41:03.119
I am well now.

41:03.119 --> 41:04.119
Yes, you are well.

41:04.840 --> 41:07.199
But I believe you can be even better.

41:07.199 --> 41:09.280
I also believe you can purge the Huxiao Gang

41:09.920 --> 41:11.159
and restore integrity to the court.

41:11.880 --> 41:14.880
And I believe
you're the wise ruler of Ning Empire,

41:15.800 --> 41:17.639
and you'll usher in a golden age for it.

41:30.239 --> 41:31.239
Good wine.

41:36.840 --> 41:38.700
I am the sovereign of a nation,

41:38.700 --> 41:40.800
revered and worshiped by all.

41:41.440 --> 41:44.519
They revere me, fear me,
and scheme against me.

41:44.519 --> 41:45.519
But only you

41:46.679 --> 41:48.119
dare to challenge me

41:49.159 --> 41:51.280
and drink and share your heart with me.

41:56.880 --> 41:59.400
Do we count as having shared our hearts?

42:01.519 --> 42:02.559
Do we not?
